# Cursor Rules for Casper Pi

## Project Structure

- `src/` - Main application source code
  - `src/mcp/` - MCP integration module
    - `src/mcp/registry.py` - Core MCP registry
    - `src/mcp/servers/` - Custom MCP server implementations
    - `src/mcp/README.md` - MCP documentation
- `cursor_tests/` - Test scripts and utilities (gitignored)
- `src/mcp/mcp_servers.json` - MCP server configuration (one place to register all servers)

## Testing

- Test scripts are located in `cursor_tests/` directory
- This directory is gitignored - test files should not be committed
- Use test scripts for development and debugging only

## MCP Server Integration

- All MCP servers are registered in `mcp_servers.json` (single configuration point)
- MCP registry automatically discovers tools from all enabled servers
- Supports both stdio and HTTP transports

## Code Style

- Follow existing patterns in the codebase
- Use type hints where appropriate
- Keep functions focused and single-purpose

